    <div class="col-12">
        <nav aria-label="breadcrumb">
            <ol class="breadcrumb">
                <li class="breadcrumb-item"><a href="/">Home</a></li>
                <li class="breadcrumb-item"><a href="/erp">ERP</a></li>
                <li class="breadcrumb-item active">Fixed Assets</li>
            </ol>
        </nav>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="row mb-5">
    <div class="col-lg-12">
        <h1 class="display-4 fw-bold mb-3">Fixed Asset Lifecycle Management</h1>
        <p class="lead mb-4">
            Professional management of your organization's capital investments, providing absolute 
            clarity on asset value, location, and depreciation throughout their useful life.
        </p>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="row mb-5">
    <div class="col-lg-12">
        <h2 class="h3 fw-bold mb-4">Comprehensive Asset Registry</h2>
        <p>
            Build a definitive master register of every capital asset held by the organization, 
            categorized by type—Land, Plant & Equipment, Vehicles, Infrastructure, and Intangible 
            Assets. The system records full acquisition details, including supplier, warranty 
            terms, and physical location. Physical identification via QR or barcode tags 
            allows for rapid field identification and stewardship tracking.
        </p>
        <p>
            Native integration with the procurement module ensures that capital asset acquisitions 
            (CAPEX) are automatically captured in the asset register once received, 
            maintaining data integrity from day zero.
        </p>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="row mb-5">
    <div class="col-lg-12">
        <h2 class="h3 fw-bold mb-4">Automated Depreciation and Valuation</h2>
        <p>
            Eliminate manual spreadsheet calculations with an automated depreciation engine that 
            supports IAS 16 and IFRS requirements. Configure depreciation rules per category— 
            straight-line, reducing balance, or units of production—and let the system 
            process monthly runs automatically. Full support for asset revaluation, 
            impairment testing (IAS 36), and adjustments to useful lifes ensures 
            that your balance sheet always reflects the true economic value of 
             your assets.
        </p>
        <p>
            Detailed gain-or-loss calculations on disposal or retirement ensure that the 
            financial impact of asset churn is accurately reflected in the profit 
            and loss statement through an immutable audit trail.
        </p>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="row mb-5">
    <div class="col-lg-12">
        <h2 class="h3 fw-bold mb-4">Stewardship and Verification</h2>
        <p>
            Protect organizational capital with structured physical verification workflows. Mobile-first 
            audits allow field teams to verify asset existence and condition via tablet or 
            smartphone, automatically updating the master register with location and 
            health status. Insurance value tracking and automated renewal alerts 
            ensure that your critical infrastructure is always adequately protected 
            against operational risk.
        </p>
        <p>
            Capital expenditure (CAPEX) budgeting allows management to plan and monitor 
            major asset investments against authorized funding, supporting long-term 
            strategic expansion and replacement cycles.
        </p>
    </div>
</div>

